{"id":"657080","name":"客家煎圆","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657080/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米粉、糖。","img":"images/657080/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"两者混合后加入适量的清水。","img":"images/657080/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入一勺猪油。","img":"images/657080/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成团，放置1小时。","img":"images/657080/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"糖完全化开即可炸。","img":"images/657080/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"先准备一碟白芝麻。","img":"images/657080/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一小团面剂搓圆。","img":"images/657080/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"表面滚上白芝麻。","img":"images/657080/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅底放入一个篦子，油加热至沸腾，放入圆子，全程中小火。","img":"images/657080/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"当圆子浮起来时，用漏勺按压圆子，再四周的转动几圈，圆子会迅速鼓起来，而且炸的会特别圆。","img":"images/657080/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炸至金黄色。","img":"images/657080/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/657080/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。表皮酥脆，内里软糯，年货必备的小吃。","img":"images/657080/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}